{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾演經典日劇《同一屋簷下》的55歲日本女星酒井法子，多年來因不老的凍齡靚樣，在藝能界向來有「怪物級美魔女」之稱。</p><p>她宣布將於明年1月27至31日主演舞台劇《吉原炎舞情》，並在社交網公開宣傳海報。</p><p>她穿上華麗的和服，化身嬌妖艷花魁，露出白滑後頸，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:24:26.687884+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T16:01:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:17:37.044238+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:17:37.044238+00:00","content_hash":"4d9faf0c28c0ca2d0e60095a06aed90ec09f707bf7408b194e2b2dac4b86e1ba","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}